  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sF0B1Ml.jpg\" alt=\"Banner\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>关于</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">这个模组将《Risk of Rain》（雨中冒险）宇宙中的一些怪物引入了 Minecraft！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; </span></strong></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>特性！</strong>&nbsp;🔍</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">怪物！</span></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h2><strong>敌人</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OmKvu4U.png\" alt=\"Lemurian\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>蜥蜴人（Lemurian）</strong> 通过向玩家喷射火球进行攻击。如果蜥蜴人与目标之间的距离较短，它会径直冲向目标并进行近战攻击。</span><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BwNNrmV.png\" alt=\"StoneGolem\" width=\"40\" height=\"58\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>石傀儡（Stone Golem）</strong> 使用从眼睛发出的缓慢充能激光攻击，该激光可以追踪目标。在近距离时，石傀儡可以通过猛击双拳来攻击。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/406824/description_b614fff8-50e4-4e7d-a82c-ac559985c7aa.png\" alt=\"Beetle\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"><br><strong>甲虫（Beetle）</strong> 唯一的攻击方式是头槌撞击目标。它们在发现玩家之前会漫无目的地跳跃。<em>像素艺术由 <strong>Kanj</strong> 制作</em>。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/406824/description_0c915cc6-58e6-4bbb-bf65-55acdf9972e4.png\" alt=\"Wisp\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"><br><strong>灵体（Wisps）</strong> 以永恒的火焰为特征，它们并非生物。每个灵体的中心都有一个面具，火焰从中喷发而出。灵体能够将热量集中成远程热射线攻击。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>无人机</strong></h2>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/llkaI3b.png\" alt=\"Gunner Drone\" width=\"25\" height=\"40\"><br>花费金币购买后，<strong>射手无人机（Gunner Drone）</strong> 会紧跟主人并从近距离射击目标。它会快速连续发射 4 发子弹。此技能冷却时间为 2 秒。如果它因受伤而冒烟，你可以用铁锭修复它。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/406824/description_10dae841-4de9-4bbc-9d71-d48b78d18886.png\" alt=\"Gunner Turret\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"><br><strong>射手炮台（Gunner Turret）</strong> 是一种无人机，它通过提供更强火力来支援玩家，代价是无法自由移动。它发射 40 发子弹，然后需要 2 秒装填。<em>像素艺术由 <strong>Kanj</strong> 制作</em>。<br></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>物品！</strong> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">可在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/riskofrain-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">Risk of Rain Items</span></span></strong></a> 模组中获得！</span></span>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/riskofrain-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🆕</span></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>为了更好地了解模组的逻辑，您可以查阅 Risk of Rain 的维基</strong><strong>：</strong>&nbsp;</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252friskofrain.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fMonsters_(Risk_of_Rain)\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">Risk of Rain Wiki</span></span></strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252friskofrain2.gamepedia.com%252fRisk_of_Rain_2_Wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">Risk of Rain 2 Wiki</span></span></strong></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>加入我们！</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ndJvphe\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">Discord</span></span></a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252felcolomanco%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>Instagram</strong></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>鸣谢</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">原始概念来自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fhopoogames.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">HOPOO GAMES</span></span></strong></a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">名称、音效和物品纹理来自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fhopoogames.com%252fgames%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">Risk of Rain 1 &amp; 2</span></span></strong></a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Minecraft 适配由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/eltoxicolo/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">Colo Champre</span></span></strong></a> 完成</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
